        "line": 70,
        "text": "noncomputable def torusAverage (f : Lift S → ℝ) (p : ℝ × S) : ℝ := ∫ y in (0:ℝ)..1, torusInner f (p, y), with torusInner f q = ∫ x in (0:ℝ)..1, f (q.1.1, (q.1.2, (x, q.2))) (:66); docstring 'The bar averages only the auxiliary torus, preserving every slow parameter.'"
